Subject: [PATCH 4/6] tap: write frames from the stack on a queue

Writing each frame inline makes the TCP sender wait for the socket, so
producing the next frame and sending this one never overlap. Queue up to
128 frames for a writer goroutine; a full queue still pushes back.
